sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant Composer as MessageUiComposer
    participant Shell as ShellService
    participant Port as HelixCommandPort
    participant Tauri as Tauri im_send_message
    participant Module as ImModule
    participant Pending as PendingSend
    participant Driver as Native Driver
    participant SQLite as SQLite message
    participant Projector as Timeline Projector
    participant Sink as Native Opaque Frame Sink
    participant Bus as im:__bus__
    participant Runtime as Angular SurfaceRuntime
    participant DOM as Timeline DOM
    participant Go as Go posts/create
    participant PG as PostgreSQL transaction
    participant WS as WebSocket post

    User->>Composer: enter text and click send
    Composer->>Shell: sendText(text)
    Shell->>Shell: active channel and req_id
    Shell->>Port: invoke im_send_message with payload
    Port->>Tauri: invokeCommand command plus payload wrapper
    Tauri-->>Port: AcceptedCommand
    Port-->>Shell: Promise resolved
    Note over Tauri,Shell: accepted=true means queued only

    Tauri->>Module: Tick::Command AppCommand
    Module->>Module: validate channel and allocate temporaryId
    Module->>Module: build CreatePostBody
    Module->>Pending: insert status=Local and correlations
    Module-->>Driver: Effect::Persist P1 optimistic message
    Module-->>Driver: Effect::Emit im:post:sending legacy diagnostic
    Note over Module,Driver: no HTTP yet for ordinary text

    Driver->>SQLite: BatchUpsert message send_status=sending
    SQLite-->>Module: Tick::PortReply P1 Ok
    Module->>Pending: status Local to Sending
    Module-->>Driver: read attached latest timeline
    Driver->>SQLite: Query timeline window
    SQLite-->>Module: Tick::PortReply rows
    Module->>Projector: compose TimelineWindowVm
    Projector-->>Driver: Effect::Emit InteractionFrameV2 sending
    Projector-->>Driver: Effect::Http posts/create
    Projector-->>Driver: Effect::ScheduleTimer 15 seconds
    Note over Projector,Driver: HTTP is released only after the sending Frame path is formed

    Driver->>Sink: DomainEventBytes event plus full V2 data
    Sink->>Sink: validate envelope object and schemaVersion=2 only
    Sink-->>Bus: emit_str im:__bus__ without business rewrite
    Bus->>Runtime: ProjectionBus to ProjectionStore to ingestTransportFrame
    Runtime->>Runtime: decode all fields and reject unknowns
    Runtime->>Runtime: check duplicate transaction and attached slot
    Runtime->>Runtime: stage epoch revision and replaceView
    Runtime->>Runtime: atomically swap staged slots plus runtime
    Runtime-->>Tauri: FrameApplied transactionId appliedSlots result
    Runtime-->>DOM: render MessageVm delivery=sending

    Driver->>Go: POST /api/cses/posts/create with Cses-Track-Id
    Go->>PG: idempotency plus post plus counters plus event plus outbox
    PG-->>Go: commit postId and eventSeq
    Go-->>Module: Tick::PortReply HTTP SUCCESS

    alt SUCCESS with server id
        Module->>Pending: reconcile id and sent
    else SUCCESS without server id
        Module->>Pending: mark sent but keep identity pending
    else PortError
        Module->>Pending: mark unsend immediately
    else malformed or non-SUCCESS
        Module->>Pending: wait for Timer
    end

    Pending-->>Driver: Effect::Persist terminal row
    Pending-->>Driver: Effect::CancelTimer when terminal is known
    Driver->>SQLite: upsert id and send_status
    SQLite-->>Module: Tick::PortReply terminal PersistOk
    Module-->>Driver: read attached latest timeline again
    Driver->>SQLite: Query timeline window
    SQLite-->>Module: Tick::PortReply terminal rows
    Module->>Projector: compose TimelineWindowVm
    Projector-->>Driver: Effect::Emit InteractionFrameV2 sent or failed
    Driver->>Sink: opaque V2 event
    Sink-->>Bus: im:__bus__
    Bus->>Runtime: full terminal Frame
    Runtime->>Runtime: stage then atomic swap
    Runtime-->>Tauri: FrameApplied
    Runtime-->>DOM: same logical row becomes sent or failed

    PG-->>WS: committed outbox publishes event=post
    WS-->>Module: Tick::Inbound post with temporaryId and eventSeq
    Module->>Pending: idempotent reconcile if still pending
    Module-->>Driver: Persist authoritative identity and event order
    opt post is gate-applied and dialog slot is materialized
        Module-->>Driver: Persist channel GuardedBump plus Get channel
        Driver->>SQLite: write counters and read authoritative channel row
        SQLite-->>Module: Tick::PortReply DialogPatchByPost
        Module->>Projector: rebuild full DialogListVm
        Projector-->>Driver: Effect::Emit dialog Frame
        Note over Projector,Driver: mutations always include left-dialog-list and may pair unread-summary
        Driver->>Sink: opaque V2 event
        Sink-->>Bus: im:__bus__
        Bus->>Runtime: dialog and optional unread transaction
        Runtime-->>DOM: dialog preview activity badges and ordering update atomically
    end
    Note over WS,DOM: observer follows its own inbound Persist barrier and Timeline Frame
    Note over Projector,Runtime: CURRENT sending and sent are two timeline-only Frames
    Note over Runtime,DOM: a WS-derived dialog Frame is conditional and independently correlated, not a fixed third command Frame
